{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-02",
  "title": "不得暫歇",
  "storyCode": "13-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "779bea22f5b8d14525fd3aa9b148811d0c721558c5b81d358a96997cfd67179c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩，你看什麼看得出神？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒什麼，媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "很少從這個角度看倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你心不在焉的樣子我太熟悉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些來自後方的絮叨讓你感到無聊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是的。我只是……還在想諾伯特區的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉。我沒有預料到倫蒂尼姆的形勢會在那麼短的時間裡發展得如此的糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我該早點安排你們全部撤離的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "倫蒂尼姆城內的所有大小事務，我們都做了分析報告，不過……我們沒能帶出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "該道歉的是我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒關係，那些大大小小的風波影響不了任何事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也許那位開斯特公爵要負大部分責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我怎麼會不知道呢？但願這一會，我的信使沒有讓她難堪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是……那些情報在後續行動中的價值是無可估量的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒什麼比你更有價值。戴菲恩，輕鬆些吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我已經來了，“加拉瓦鐵盾”也就在附近，等我們返回那座城裡，一切都會重回正軌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我會讓它們恢復如初的，戴菲恩，無論是倫蒂尼姆，還是維多利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽，我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我本以為我會死在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是我的女兒。我不會讓那種事情發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些年你做得很好。在仔細和耐心這方面，你和你爸簡直一模一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但那些工作未必需要你去做。你是我的繼承人，你更應該留在麗茵卡登。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們和萊塔尼亞的對峙很能磨鍊人，那些事務你需要熟悉，而我……也缺個能說說話的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我當時覺得，我能做得更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一位“溫德米爾公爵”可能需要操心一大把事情，讓自己變得和鋼鐵一般堅硬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你還不需要承擔，起碼現在還不需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在媽媽還沒老得走不動路之前，你都可以依賴我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的……謝謝您，媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再過四五個小時，我們就可以回家了，我讓侍女把你留在領地的東西都帶過來布置好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的睡衣，你的枕頭，你的床，你的浴缸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那都是我來倫蒂尼姆之前的東西了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你也沒長高多少，我看照樣能用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我還給你準備了點好東西，不過暫時保密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等到我們回去，你可以先好好睡一覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過也別太早掉以輕心，我們還有很多事要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在倫蒂尼姆，待了很久了吧，媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我曾經有很多同僚，他們都很優秀，真的，值得我學習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們在混亂的城市裡，嚼碎自己原本的生活往肚子裡吞。可當時我們都相信這份事業，我真的一度以此為豪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可再後來……情況變了。情報人員一個一個消失，薩卡茲光明正大接管城市……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我孤立無援，只能和一些……更普通一些的人生活。我第一次知道他們的生活是什麼樣的，他們看待維多利亞的方式是什麼樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可……再後來，他們大都死了。活下來的那部分，正在這座艦船的底部，擁擠在一起，等待您的發落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就在我的睡衣，床，和浴缸下方一百米處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我很感謝您，真的。但這是不是都因為——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你確實做得夠好了，超乎預期，我的女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在，去看看下方的部隊吧，你確實需要多和他們接觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "還有什麼話，等一下再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您不該親自來這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這樣……風險太大了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們不能輕易地相信萊塔尼亞人！我們也不知道薩卡茲們的下一步計劃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們的情報已經滯後——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們帶出來的食物還能撐多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這艘軍艦似乎並沒有做好接納這麼多難民的準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那我們總不能放著大家不管吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "剛才，埃米爾太太拉著我的手，她什麼也沒說，只是看著我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我……受不了這個，我們去找戴菲恩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "漢娜，冷靜點。我們現在是在別人的戰艦上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "待會我再去陪陪他們，那幾位上了年紀的老人，看見些熟面孔，心裡也會好受一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我也和你們一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "久等了，我剛和軍需官溝通過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一些食物會被送到最需要的人手上……這已經是我能做到的極限了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……感謝，戴菲恩，還有溫德米爾公爵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "出於私心，我希望媽媽是真心想幫助這些可憐人，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道，是因為我，或者說我的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過，只要能幫上和我們一起逃出來的人就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你適應得很快，維娜小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在已經不是我們能恣意而為的時候了，戴菲恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "船上還有很多人得依靠我。無論是維娜還是推進之王，都對他們……負有責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在外面的戰況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戰報多到匪夷所思。變數太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "簡單地說，威靈頓公爵的進攻鋒線並不穩定，而我們自己的防線也被擠壓得很厲害……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明明論兵力，即使公爵們還沒有全力以赴，也應該是壓倒性的優勢。我們所面臨的已經超過了現代戰爭理論的範疇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“食腐者之王”……我們甚至只能在古老的典籍和考古文獻裡找到關於他們的記述。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而維多利亞，不，整個泰拉已經太久沒有面對過一支真正的薩卡茲大軍團了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們的巫術會形成什麼樣的連鎖反應？他們的手段當真有資料裡貶損的那麼落後原始？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在我們看不見的地方，各個分支的薩卡茲們集結成了一股怎樣的力量？他們為何站在一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是也不用太擔心。媽……溫德米爾公爵會與威靈頓公爵聯席指揮這場戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "開斯特公爵也已經明確表態了，僵持不會持續太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等我們返回“加拉瓦鐵盾”後，物資補給和前線支援都會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔哦！怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看來我們在穿越一片峽谷……這是個好訊號。我們就快離開戰場了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……推進之王，軍艦是不是在減速？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒錯。而且外面的天氣……等等，現在是幾點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們離開諾伯特區多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？大概幾個小時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這片峽谷只是普通的峽谷嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔，沒什麼特別的，只有一些荒廢的工業區……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，老兄，小心點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，和你說話呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "離他遠點，漢娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——戒備！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "血、血霧？是薩卡茲的巫術！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這裡平民太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "摩根，達格達，因陀羅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "往下走！樓梯在北邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是，船醫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "本艦遭到了巫術襲擊，隨軍術師短時間內解讀不了這種巫術的作用，公爵和——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希勒少尉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "該死——他們怎麼已經——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）血魔的巫術生效了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我見過你們的裝束，戴骷髏面具的薩卡茲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）諸王之息……減少變數吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）製造混亂，清除異族。不要吝嗇自己的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們參與了圍攻我們塔樓騎士的行動……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小心，我接住你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）維多利亞人，和你們的王一起死在這裡好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（媽媽就在甲板上，可下面還有平民和我們的人……我……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩，你左邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小心點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抱歉，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們人數不多，我們能夠壓制，再退一道門就是安全艙，先讓平民前往那裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，你有更重要的事去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些人是跟著我撤下來的，我承諾過保證他們的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "溫德米爾公爵極有可能還不知道下面……糟糕的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "去告訴她這裡的事，我會撐到你們的援軍過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們有完備的軍事指揮體系，我們沒辦法短時間融入到你們的戰鬥隊伍中，這樣的任務更適合我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "維娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶……你頭可真硬，震得我手發麻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "*薩卡茲粗口*……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）算了，諸王之息也會是不錯的戰果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）全員，包圍那個阿斯蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大伙，準備幹架了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們的放肆，到此為止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩……不要往前走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你受傷了，你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你會礙事。我也會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在這……詭異的玩意把我吞噬之前，你要殺死我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "劍衛們，會和公爵閣下，殺死那隻薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩……你不能冒險……你不能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔……我甚至感覺不到疼痛了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "救救我。然後就在這裡停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩——閣下，活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——感謝您——救了——我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這就是……薩卡茲的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "女士，你不該躲開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的臉色這麼蒼白，要是那些血能順利濺到你的臉上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "它們會為你妝點出更漂亮的絕望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "玩弄血液是你們的習性嗎，蛭蟲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們活了成百上千年，似乎沒什麼長進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "適合死亡的天氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劍衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "公爵，這是有預謀的襲擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "與預期一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只是，居然是薩卡茲的君王親自來訪……哼，也行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劍衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "下面的情況並不樂觀，軍官們正在組織防守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不必在意，我們的威脅，只有他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我早就受夠了萊塔尼亞的高塔藝術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不知道血魔的脊骨會是什麼形狀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是個強大的維多利亞人，你很堅強，你覺得你不會退縮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但血液會背叛你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "造物主為人類準備了生命的橋梁，而我身在橋梁之上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒比高塔怪胎們難纏多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可憐的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你依舊對某些事情抱有不切實際的幻想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也許你能猜一猜，為什麼你們的軍艦會從內部被突然攻破呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "集中於眼前的任務，衛士們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "擺好架勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劍衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們的使命是殺死溫德米爾的敵人，而不是保護溫德米爾的性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "切實地削弱薩卡茲的力量，維多利亞會奪回自己的財產。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你確實有一些本事……嗯。當然，你是維多利亞的公爵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你吃過多少薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒有這麼噁心的癖好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你和你的祖先們叱咤戰場，從卡西米爾到萊塔尼亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "溫德米爾公爵曾領有一支薩卡茲軍隊。在那場險些波及整片大地的戰爭中，四國戰爭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你……或是你的祖先，是怎麼使用他們的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "設計好的伎倆，偷竊來的巫術，也是食腐者熱愛的把戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲的血肉被塗抹在戰場上，成了你們光榮戰艦前行航線上的又一道壁壘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦……你可把他們吃乾抹淨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你要來尋仇嗎，薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們竟然敢擺弄我所創下的藝法，玩弄屬於鮮血王庭的財產？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劍衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……那些血，死傷者的鮮血在強化他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那已經不再是流淌在血管裡的體液，那已經成了詛咒的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "準備反制法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……難道……不……能轉移軍隊的法術本就聞所未聞……我們的軍艦是從內部被攻破……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那個感覺……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……但血魔呢？如果他有辦法用巫術襲擊那些軍官，為什麼不直接對目標下手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不……先用巫術襲擊一些次要目標，再讓刺客製造混亂……這太多此一舉了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是，和媽媽廝殺的那個薩卡茲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "變形者……他僅僅只是變成了維多利亞人的樣貌，混入了我們之中嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩？！退下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他是假的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不喜歡見到第二個我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你被一個小姑娘識破了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你退步了，變形者，上個你要更像些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些法術只是赦罪師劣質而可恨的模仿罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "腥臭，不雅，滿是粗劣的殺戮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我、我在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你及時發現了真相，很好，否則劍衛們會全軍覆沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但現在，你很礙事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——我、我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "護航艦隊正在接近。我們需要確保通訊塔的安全，避免我們與艦隊之間的聯絡中斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "通訊塔……就在甲板後面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "敵人的數量不算多，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……就交給你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "太好了，通訊塔的情況還在控制之中——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "軍艦在減速？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……發動機！他們進攻了動力艙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "該、該死——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抓住我的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別朝後看！爬起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，謝謝！您是，戴菲恩閣下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們要重組攻勢，援軍很快就到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戰士們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我能看到遠方的煙塵了，我們的援軍正在接近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們這次的計劃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩！躲開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈啊……哈啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你沒事吧？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，只是心理上的……我沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "下面的敵人攻勢已經被你們的部隊限制，我們上來支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "壞消息，我們在下面發現了變形者的蹤跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們已經知道了，血魔大君正在和變形者交替進攻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，等等……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩，你要去哪裡？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呿，真難纏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）血的味道變了。赦罪師閣下已經得手，大君也取得了勝利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赦罪師直屬衛兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）無法自如行動的人，聽我號令，將匕首插入胸膛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……你的雙臂已經失去知覺，你的護衛們也潰不成軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你現在，正懷抱著什麼形狀的情感？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……哈啊……哈啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他抓住了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一瞬間的破綻，一瞬間的自亂陣腳……為什麼？我們不理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們……感到惋惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她已經沒救了。就讓這位強大的戰士獨自品味生命的凋零吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你要離開？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "餘下的不過是卑小的死亡。罷了，我實在是提不起興趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些血，千篇一律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你在追求什麼？我們……還不確定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "屈辱的時代就要結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你受傷了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……無關緊要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你……你們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……嗯，你在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是那個識破了我們的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他說我們退步了……上一個我們，有多像？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這樣，足夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你——別頂著她的臉——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……我們需要嘗試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "變形者集群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）下次，我們會做得更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……戴菲恩……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我有點看不清……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們撤退了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽……媽……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們……離開了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽，你……我馬上叫醫生來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不會有事的，你可是溫德米爾公爵！你可是我的媽媽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等著我，我馬上就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我竟然……沒能解決掉他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別走……戴菲恩，別走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "讓我……看看你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我……沒哭，媽媽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我看到你揮劍了，戴菲恩……很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的手受過傷，握劍的姿勢……總是不對。我那時，太急於求成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽……別說了，媽媽……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我還記得……你爸最後離開的方向……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "本來，我們有個驚喜，很早以前就為你準備的驚喜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "媽媽……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴菲恩，你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我還以為……會更高一點，衣服有點大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫德米爾公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戴……菲恩，別著急……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
